      "category": "BEHAVIORAL",
      "subject": "server",
      "stage": "sip_fsm",
      "description": "Although the CANCEL method does take a response (a 2xx), servers MUST NOT attempt to challenge CANCEL requests since these requests cannot be resubmitted.",
